    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🏢 1. Three-Branch Ingestion\n- `Manual_Trigger` triggers all 3 sources simultaneously:\n  - **Branch 1:** CRM Master Profiles (Acme & Beta)\n  - **Branch 2:** SQL Database Transactions\n  - **Branch 3:** Binary PDF Expense Invoice Generation",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
