      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔀 3. Two-Stage Relational Synchronization\n- `Merge_CRM_With_SQL`: Combines CRM profiles with SQL revenue on `customerId`.\n- `Merge_With_PDFExpenses`: Enriches the unified entity with parsed PDF expense line items on `customerId`.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e6a10001-0014-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Sticky_Two_Stage_Merge",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 4. Customer 360 Analytics & Warehouse Sync\n- `Transform_ComputeCustomer360`: Calculates `netProfit`, `profitMarginPercent`, and assigns tiers.\n- `HTTP_PostToWarehouse`: Dispatches profiles to Cloud Data Warehouse with 3x retry policy.\n- `Code_AuditSummary`: Emits final execution telemetry.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e6a10001-0015-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Sticky_Analytics_Sync",
